w\in \mathsf{W}_{\Gamma_\delta,r}}
\frac{r^{-h^1(\Gamma_\delta)}}{|\Aut(\Gamma_\delta)| }
\prod_{e=(h,h')\in \E(\Gamma_\delta)}
