\, .\]
By \cref{Lem:vertterm},
    \[-\eta + \sum_{i=1}^n (2 a_i \xi_i+ a_i^2 \psi_i) = - \pi_* c_1(\mathcal{L}_A)^2.\]
Now consider the diagram of universal curves
